    {
      "richtext": "The Board of Directors is SDCA’s highest governing body. The Board currently consists of nine members. All Board Members are elected at The Annual Meeting to serve a two-year term. Re-election is limited to a one additional term. The Board is ultimately responsible for all SDCA affairs."
    },
    {
      "image": {
        "src": "/img/old/2019/image3.jpeg",
        "alt": "",
        "caption": "",
        "width": null,
        "height": null,
        "sha256": "eb96eaeaa79ffd61e42cd93d74fd3d507ad9e88a3dc7333f17db8333ac829620",
        "local_path": "/Users/Maxi/Code/SDCA/research/assets/images/image3.jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "richtext": "Over all these years, through the hard work and dedication from – both past and present – Principals, faculty/staff members, Board of Directors, PTA chairpersons, Community Service (CS) coordinators and parent volunteers, SDCA is standing strongly tall. By offering an excellent environment for learning Chinese to our students and the community, we look forward to continuing to serve everyone who is interested in Chinese culture as well as learning the language for many years to come."
    },
